<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<p>The Master of Professional Studies is awarded for completion of 30 credits. Students must maintain a 3.0 cumulative grade point average and fulfill all requirements in a timely manner.</p>
<p>The one-year curriculum requires full-time enrollment.</p>
{% for semester in curriculum %}
	<h2>{{ semester.first | capitalize }} semester</h2>
	<table>
		<tbody>
			{% for course in semester.last %}
				<tr>
					<td>
						{%- if course.number %}
							<p>{{course.number}}</p>
						{% endif %}
						<p>{{course.credits}} Credits</p>
					</td>
					<td>
						<a href="{{ courseCatalog | append: course.number | remove: ' ' }}">
							<p>{{course.title}}</p>
						</a>
					</td>
				</tr>
			{% endfor %}
		</tbody>
	</table>
{% endfor %}
<p>For a complete listing of courses and descriptions, including elective options, visit the <a href="{{ courseCatalog }}">The New School’s Course Catalog</a>.</p>
